#: ../../tools/kegg_disease_drug_tools.rst:32 e9dd89d78ad94d9aa2bfd97b02ad6a0f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed KEGG disease information including disease "
"name, category, description, associated genes (with "
"mutations/translocations), pathways, therapeutic drugs, database cross-"
"references (ICD-10, MeSH, OMIM), and references. Example: H00001 returns "
"B-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia with BCR-ABL, MLL-AF4, E2A-PBX1 gene "
"fusions and 10+ associated pathways. Use KEGG\\_search\\_disease to find "
"disease IDs."
msgstr ""

