#: ../../tools/kegg_disease_drug_tools.rst:97 d792620499144a2bb0e712a2816343dc
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed KEGG drug information including names, "
"formula, molecular weight, drug targets, associated pathways, indicated "
"diseases, efficacy description, cross-references (DrugBank, PubChem, "
"CAS), and marketed products. Example: D00109 (aspirin) returns formula "
"C9H8O4, targets PTGS1/PTGS2 (cyclooxygenase 1/2), and indications for "
"pain/inflammation. Use KEGG\\_search\\_drug to find drug IDs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/kegg_disease_drug_tools.rst:101 62d4548d6131406fb80229ca6e26275c
msgid ""
