#: ../../tools/kegg_disease_drug_tools.rst:159 e0346df8a7754f9e852fed36923a60dc
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the KEGG DISEASE database by keyword. KEGG "
"DISEASE contains 2,600+ human disease entries with associated genes, "
"pathways, drugs, and cross-references. Returns disease IDs (H#####) and "
"names. Example: searching 'leukemia' returns H00001 B-cell acute "
"lymphoblastic leukemia, H00002 T-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia, etc. "
"Use KEGG\\_get\\_disease for full details including genes and pathways."
msgstr ""

